--- !u!114 &295609452
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 295609450}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> DiceBoardService.Place
    / CanPlace / CanPlaceAnywhere / TryFindPlacement / MinMergeGroupSize, DicePieceGenerator.Generate,
    DicePiece.RotateClockwise.\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b>
    Select GridSystem_DiceMerge: FieldGenerator (5\xD75), DiceBoardService (merge
    group, step, cap), DiceMergeDemoController (game loop) and DiceMergeDemoView
    (art and prefabs).\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  <b>Verification:</b> Play: place
    dice, merge three equal neighbours to score; when the next piece fits nowhere
    (CanPlaceAnywhere) the run is over - press Restart.\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color> 
    Hint -> DiceBoardService.TryFindPlacement; the slider sets MinMergeGroupSize
    live.\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  DiceBoardService.OnMergesResolved -> DiceMergeDemoController.HandleMergesResolved
    (Inspector).\n<color=#FAB84C>\xBB</color>  [Demo] Board Preview shows the layout
    in Edit Mode; the view draws the real board on Play."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
